<title>INDONESIA: Medco 1996 net up to 40.21 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Medco 1996 net up to 40.21 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  40.21   vs   28.19</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    233    vs   164</p>
<p>    Net revenues			360.36  vs  119.85</p>
<p>    Gross profit			165.06  vs   56.20</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  114.27  vs   31.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     75.37  vs   36.24</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  79.16  vs   46.56</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT Medco Energi Corporation is an energy company. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
